### audit health
GET http://localhost:8089/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: manual-audit-health

### audit liveness
GET http://localhost:8089/actuator/health/liveness

### audit prometheus
GET http://localhost:8089/actuator/prometheus

### P18: the in-app inbox (a user token from identity's /v1/auth/login)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P18: preferences (If-Match "0" before the first save)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/notification-prefs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "0"
Content-Type: application/json

{"muted": ["commerce"], "push": false}

### P18: export my data (step-up: a fresh sign-in)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/privacy/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

### P18: the audit log (admin token with audit:read)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P18: verify the chain
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/audit:verify-chain
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P18: activity dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/activity/dashboard?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
